# X Marks the Spot (otherAreas 65): the available check's false side at its edge. CoP An Eternal Melody current (238,
# just below Ancient Vows, 248): no section; Despachiaire answers CoP 2-2's completed 106. A trade to Odeya while the
# quest is available: no trade handler, nothing. (The CoP mission is set before the login: a GM's addMission over a
# current one logs `lua: addMission: overwriting current mission`, which the recorder refuses; the true side, Ancient
# Vows current, is in the main flow and #trades.)
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Parelbriaux/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Odeya/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Odeya/onTrade TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/141 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/142 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/143 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/144 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/145 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/148 PhomiunaAqueducts/_0r9/onTrigger PhomiunaAqueducts/onEventFinish/37
lists TavnazianSafehold/onZoneOut/1
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop AnEternalMelody current
item TavnazianLiver
login
trigger Despachiaire                    # 238: no section; 106
finish
warp 86.3,-34.25,-71.1 TavnazianSafehold
trade Odeya TavnazianLiver x1           # available: no trade handler; nothing
